Significance: patch
Type: fix

Keep the Cart/Checkout incompatible extensions notices dismissed when an incompatible payment gateway or extension is disabled. Both the editor sidebar notice and the storefront admin banner stay dismissed for the ones that remain, and warn again only when something becomes incompatible that the merchant has not already acknowledged, so re-enabling a gateway or reactivating an extension warns again. The storefront banner no longer shares a localStorage key with the editor notice, and both keys are now scoped to the site, so one site of a multisite network can no longer hide another one's warning. Dismissals made before that change are carried over on single-site installs.
